Here is the "fix" for SYSTEM III unix.
You might be able to use dup(2) if running V7 but the rules
for determining which fd gets duped to are different.

#include <fcntl.h>

	fclose(stdout);
	fcntl(SaveOut, F_DUPFD, 1);
/*	dup2(SaveOut, 1);	*/
